WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Husband, it’s early in the morning. It’s nothing. Someone is thinking

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,360
A certain family is born to be a great civil servant.

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,000
Look at how many soldiers and horses a certain company has recruited in the past few days. This is a logistical method.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,560
No one in the court can serve a certain purpose

5
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,040
Husband, what is the use of recruiting so many soldiers?

6
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,720
Nowadays, although the new dynasty has sufficient troops,

7
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,480
But there is a lack of independent and capable generals.

8
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,040
Maybe one day the king will issue a decree

9
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,280
Just show off your husband and go to the battle to show off your approval.

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,400
Madam, what you said makes sense.

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,920
How is it possible for Wang Tiantian to use a civil servant from a certain family as a military officer?

12
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,160
What clever plan does that husband have?

13
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,480
Song Wei: There must be a brave man with a lot of money

14
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,840
Then a certain family will give you a thousand taels of gold

15
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,080
Recruiting the world’s most powerful generals

16
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,240
As long as the fierce general has enough control

17
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,760
It's a trivial matter to see who can force a certain family to go to the battlefield.

18
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,080
Is it difficult for you, your husband, to be a big fish like me?

19
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,160
The first civil servant and counselor

20
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,640
The first civil servant and counselor

21
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,120
You obviously appointed yourself

22
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:44,180
Madam, Mr. Li, why don't you wake up?

23
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,060
There's another half-hearted person here to try and get some reward money.

24
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,500
This time, two real masters came

25
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,580
They are all the peak Tibetan husbands

26
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,660
There are only seven strikes left to go straight to the innate world. Quickly lead the way.

27
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:54,950
I went with a certain company to inspect the goods and did nothing.

28
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:55,910
I haven’t paid my respects yet, sir.
